{
  "durationInSeconds": 95.18908333333333,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "start": 0.3,
      "end": 4.061,
      "text": "You wrote the program that picks the lottery numbers, so what stops you from winning?"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "start": 4.360916666666666,
      "end": 6.0849166666666665,
      "text": "Eddie Tipton's employer had an answer."
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "start": 6.205125,
      "end": 10.656125,
      "text": "The draw computers sat in a locked glass room, on camera, never on the internet."
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "start": 10.776333333333334,
      "end": 13.570333333333334,
      "text": "There were two of them, and officials flipped a coin to choose one."
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "start": 13.690708333333333,
      "end": 16.323708333333332,
      "text": "And staff like Tipton could not even collect a prize."
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 16.623833333333334,
      "end": 18.664833333333334,
      "text": "Tipton was the security expert."
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 18.784458333333333,
      "end": 23.127458333333333,
      "text": "He had warned a national conference about programs that secretly change how a computer works."
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 23.247374999999998,
      "end": 26.411375,
      "text": "In November twenty ten, he went into that room to change the clocks."
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 26.531125,
      "end": 28.245124999999998,
      "text": "That day, the camera was malfunctioning."
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 28.364625,
      "end": 30.854625,
      "text": "It recorded one second out of every minute."
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 31.454916666666666,
      "end": 33.371916666666664,
      "text": "Nobody in the room saw anything unusual."
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 33.492416666666664,
      "end": 34.992416666666664,
      "text": "They relied on his expertise."
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 35.291916666666665,
      "end": 38.83891666666666,
      "text": "Thirty-three days later, someone bought a ticket at a Des Moines convenience store."
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 38.95875,
      "end": 41.021750000000004,
      "text": "Six days after that, it hit the jackpot."
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 41.14183333333334,
      "end": 42.97083333333334,
      "text": "Sixteen and a half million dollars."
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 43.09041666666667,
      "end": 43.82141666666667,
      "text": "And nobody came."
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 44.621583333333334,
      "end": 46.83358333333334,
      "text": "Then, almost a year later, a man in Quebec called."
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 46.953875000000004,
      "end": 48.704875,
      "text": "He knew the ticket's fifteen-digit number."
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 48.825208333333336,
      "end": 50.770208333333336,
      "text": "But his story did not match the store's video."
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 50.89033333333334,
      "end": 52.77133333333334,
      "text": "Next came a blind trust in Belize."
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 52.89095833333334,
      "end": 55.909958333333336,
      "text": "Then, about an hour before the deadline, a lawyer walked in with the ticket."
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 56.03033333333334,
      "end": 56.73633333333334,
      "text": "Still no name."
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 56.85629166666667,
      "end": 58.04329166666667,
      "text": "The lottery refused to pay."
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s5",
      "start": 58.543625000000006,
      "end": 60.53662500000001,
      "text": "For almost three years, nobody had a name."
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s5",
      "start": 60.65654166666667,
      "end": 62.52254166666667,
      "text": "So investigators released the store's video."
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s5",
      "start": 62.642541666666666,
      "end": 65.45454166666667,
      "text": "Six days later, a lottery employee in Maine sent a tip."
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 65.574625,
      "end": 68.676625,
      "text": "The man buying that ticket, the tip said, was Eddie Tipton."
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 69.47670833333333,
      "end": 70.70570833333333,
      "text": "He said he had been in Houston."
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 70.82545833333333,
      "end": 74.30145833333333,
      "text": "Then in twenty seventeen, he told a court about his code."
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 74.42158333333333,
      "end": 76.96758333333334,
      "text": "On certain days, it made the numbers predictable."
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 77.08770833333332,
      "end": 78.12970833333333,
      "text": "It went back years."
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 78.24983333333333,
      "end": 83.29983333333332,
      "text": "His brother and a friend played those numbers in other states, for two point two million dollars."
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 83.41937499999999,
      "end": 85.462375,
      "text": "His sentence was up to twenty-five years."
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "scene": "s7",
      "start": 85.76208333333332,
      "end": 88.29908333333333,
      "text": "The sixteen and a half million was never paid."
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "scene": "s7",
      "start": 88.41929166666665,
      "end": 89.87029166666665,
      "text": "His code beat a locked room."
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "scene": "s7",
      "start": 90.07054166666666,
      "end": 91.39954166666665,
      "text": "A store camera beat him."
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "scene": "s7",
      "start": 91.99995833333332,
      "end": 94.88895833333332,
      "text": "So who checks the man who writes the numbers?"
    }
  ]
}
